1
00:01:32,910 --> 00:01:38,250
[First Love Again]

2
00:01:38,420 --> 00:01:40,900
[Episode 21]

3
00:01:45,789 --> 00:01:49,350
[Bai Xue Entertainment]

4
00:01:55,820 --> 00:02:00,470
[Own the Court. Take Action Now.]

5
00:01:58,789 --> 00:01:59,560
Li Sirui.

6
00:02:03,760 --> 00:02:05,160
[Own the Court. Take Action Now.]

7
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:04,870
You never answer my calls,

8
00:02:04,870 --> 00:02:06,000
and all I get from you on WeChat
are a few emojis.

9
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:07,310
What's that supposed to mean?

10
00:02:07,310 --> 00:02:07,920
Come on, let's go talk outside.

11
00:02:07,760 --> 00:02:09,110
[Bai Xue Entertainment]

12
00:02:07,920 --> 00:02:08,979
Can't we talk here?

13
00:02:13,240 --> 00:02:13,960
Xiaotao.

14
00:02:14,870 --> 00:02:17,280
I'm sorry. I've been really busy lately.

15
00:02:17,590 --> 00:02:18,520
Busy with what?

16
00:02:18,630 --> 00:02:21,690
Busy abandoning your teammates
to sign with an agency?

17
00:02:24,750 --> 00:02:26,350
Why did you sign with Bai Xue?

18
00:02:29,190 --> 00:02:30,520
That's my own business.

19
00:02:30,680 --> 00:02:31,630
For the past 3 years,

20
00:02:31,630 --> 00:02:32,590
all you've thought about is

21
00:02:32,590 --> 00:02:34,030
winning the championship
with Gu Han and the others.

22
00:02:34,030 --> 00:02:35,560
Why are you giving it up now?

23
00:02:38,710 --> 00:02:40,310
This is a great opportunity.

24
00:02:42,030 --> 00:02:43,430
There's no other reason.

25
00:02:45,520 --> 00:02:46,470
Li Sirui,

26
00:02:46,960 --> 00:02:49,240
you might fool everyone else,
but do you really think you can fool me?

27
00:02:49,240 --> 00:02:50,430
What's going on with you?

28
00:02:50,430 --> 00:02:51,470
Nothing's going on.

29
00:02:51,470 --> 00:02:52,910
Now that I'm working with Bai Xue,

30
00:02:52,910 --> 00:02:54,079
I have a chance
to play in the professional league

31
00:02:54,079 --> 00:02:55,190
and even appear on variety shows!

32
00:02:55,190 --> 00:02:56,079
Isn't that a good thing?

33
00:02:55,300 --> 00:03:02,220
[Own the Court. Take Action Now.]

34
00:03:05,080 --> 00:03:06,610
Then why didn't you discuss

35
00:03:06,710 --> 00:03:09,240
such an important matter
with me beforehand?

36
00:03:09,520 --> 00:03:10,840
Do you even still

37
00:03:11,310 --> 00:03:13,040
think of me as your girlfriend?

38
00:03:16,720 --> 00:03:18,290
[Ms. Bai]

39
00:03:21,140 --> 00:03:22,280
[Ms. Bai]

40
00:03:24,630 --> 00:03:25,840
Hello, Ms. Bai.

41
00:03:27,710 --> 00:03:29,110
I'm still at the company.

42
00:03:30,680 --> 00:03:32,480
No problem. I'll be right there.

43
00:03:32,840 --> 00:03:33,700
See you in a bit.

44
00:03:43,800 --> 00:03:44,680
Li Sirui,

45
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:47,680
don't you have anything to say to me?

46
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:24,480
Why are you here?

47
00:04:25,480 --> 00:04:26,680
To take you to school.

48
00:04:28,430 --> 00:04:29,120
The key.

49
00:04:47,480 --> 00:04:49,430
How is it? Pretty steady, right?

50
00:04:54,390 --> 00:04:55,190
Um...

51
00:04:55,800 --> 00:04:57,120
You got your driver's license, right?

52
00:04:57,120 --> 00:04:58,190
Of course.

53
00:04:58,310 --> 00:05:00,160
I got it
right after the college entrance exams.

54
00:05:00,160 --> 00:05:01,360
And I passed on the first try.

55
00:05:01,360 --> 00:05:02,560
I was pretty awesome.

56
00:05:03,070 --> 00:05:05,270
You could say I'm a seasoned driver now.

57
00:05:08,950 --> 00:05:09,720
But...

58
00:05:10,480 --> 00:05:13,340
today is actually my first time
driving on the road.

59
00:05:15,120 --> 00:05:16,180
You're doing well.

60
00:05:24,800 --> 00:05:25,560
Um...

61
00:05:26,190 --> 00:05:28,390
Maybe we could speed up a bit?

62
00:05:28,600 --> 00:05:30,070
Y-You're injured.

63
00:05:30,070 --> 00:05:31,560
You don't need to worry about that.

64
00:05:31,560 --> 00:05:33,000
I'm a cautious driver.

65
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:34,060
Just leave it to me.

66
00:05:35,630 --> 00:05:36,360
Okay.

67
00:05:42,630 --> 00:05:43,430
But...

68
00:05:44,240 --> 00:05:47,070
this is my first time driving on the road,
and I'm doing it just for you.

69
00:05:47,070 --> 00:05:49,510
Well? Aren't you a little touched?

70
00:05:49,510 --> 00:05:50,440
Eyes on the road.

71
00:05:52,430 --> 00:05:53,890
I'm touched, I'm touched.

72
00:05:54,720 --> 00:05:56,190
Today we're covering

73
00:05:56,240 --> 00:05:59,370
the urban economic thought
of medieval Western Europe.

74
00:06:00,160 --> 00:06:00,830
First.

75
00:06:01,270 --> 00:06:02,800
-What now?
-The economic program

76
00:06:02,800 --> 00:06:04,120
-of the urban communal revolutions.
-I'll take notes for you.

77
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:05,650
-You just need to listen.
-In the past,

78
00:06:05,650 --> 00:06:09,510
-I hurt my knee, not my hand.
-it was to abolish serfdom within cities.

79
00:06:09,870 --> 00:06:12,600
Second, guild economic thought.

80
00:06:13,510 --> 00:06:16,270
First, it adopted the traditional

81
00:06:16,270 --> 00:06:19,630
communal principles of
medieval Western European rural society.

82
00:06:19,630 --> 00:06:21,700
No one was allowed to monopolize anything.

83
00:06:21,700 --> 00:06:23,360
[Third, monopoly]

84
00:06:21,750 --> 00:06:23,040
That means monopolies

85
00:06:23,040 --> 00:06:23,950
within a trade

86
00:06:23,950 --> 00:06:24,830
-or outside a trade...
-You don't need to type this out.

87
00:06:24,830 --> 00:06:25,890
It's too detailed.

88
00:06:27,160 --> 00:06:27,920
Fourth,

89
00:06:28,360 --> 00:06:32,159
price controls were part of the system
of economic regulation.

90
00:06:34,620 --> 00:06:36,140
[Third, monopoly:
both within and outside a trade.]

91
00:06:40,430 --> 00:06:41,290
You made a typo.

92
00:06:45,750 --> 00:06:46,800
Here they come.

93
00:06:47,510 --> 00:06:48,360
That's a lot!

94
00:06:49,510 --> 00:06:50,680
And there's more.

95
00:06:52,630 --> 00:06:53,240
This is enough.

96
00:06:53,240 --> 00:06:54,040
Just a moment.

97
00:06:59,950 --> 00:07:00,680
Are you sure

98
00:07:00,680 --> 00:07:02,480
the two of us can finish all this?

99
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:04,270
You're injured,

100
00:07:04,430 --> 00:07:06,680
so you need to build yourself up properly

101
00:07:06,680 --> 00:07:08,040
to recover faster.

102
00:07:08,600 --> 00:07:09,390
I read online that foods

103
00:07:09,390 --> 00:07:11,360
like bone broth and pig's blood

104
00:07:11,360 --> 00:07:12,690
can help with recovery.

105
00:07:14,310 --> 00:07:14,950
Here.

106
00:07:15,920 --> 00:07:18,320
My hands aren't injured.
I can eat on my own.

107
00:07:19,190 --> 00:07:20,800
Didn't you ask me to feed you before,

108
00:07:20,800 --> 00:07:22,630
when you were pretending to be hurt?

109
00:07:22,630 --> 00:07:23,160
Come on.

110
00:07:24,120 --> 00:07:25,120
I asked you to put some food on my plate,

111
00:07:25,120 --> 00:07:26,000
not feed me.

112
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:26,930
Open your mouth.

113
00:07:42,270 --> 00:07:42,950
Here.

114
00:07:43,390 --> 00:07:44,320
Eat it yourself.

115
00:07:50,310 --> 00:07:51,950
Come on. Here.

116
00:08:08,270 --> 00:08:09,600
You've gained 5 pounds.

117
00:08:11,920 --> 00:08:12,510
Come on.

118
00:08:18,680 --> 00:08:19,680
Go sit for a while.

119
00:08:19,680 --> 00:08:20,630
More sitting?

120
00:08:25,920 --> 00:08:28,070
Come on, at least
let me move around a little.

121
00:08:28,070 --> 00:08:29,270
I've already gained 5 pounds.

122
00:08:29,270 --> 00:08:30,390
The games are coming up.

123
00:08:30,390 --> 00:08:31,630
After you recover,

124
00:08:31,630 --> 00:08:34,159
you'll have plenty of chances
to move around.

125
00:08:49,550 --> 00:08:51,360
Why are you standing up again?

126
00:08:52,440 --> 00:08:53,510
Do you need something?

127
00:08:53,510 --> 00:08:54,510
I-I don't need anything.

128
00:08:54,510 --> 00:08:55,750
You want some water, right?

129
00:08:55,750 --> 00:08:56,870
No. No.

130
00:08:57,480 --> 00:08:58,390
Coming right up.

131
00:08:58,390 --> 00:08:59,030
Sit down.

132
00:09:02,320 --> 00:09:04,080
Here's the water.

133
00:09:07,550 --> 00:09:08,610
Well, Xiangxiang.

134
00:09:09,870 --> 00:09:10,750
Le Xiaotao!

135
00:09:11,320 --> 00:09:12,960
You haven't gotten together
with Xiaotao and the others in ages.

136
00:09:12,960 --> 00:09:14,420
Shouldn't you go see them?

137
00:09:15,720 --> 00:09:17,480
Xiaotao has a boyfriend,

138
00:09:17,480 --> 00:09:19,080
and I have mine.

139
00:09:19,320 --> 00:09:20,440
Last time you got injured,

140
00:09:20,440 --> 00:09:22,030
I didn't take good enough care of you.

141
00:09:22,030 --> 00:09:23,720
This time, I'm going to
take really good care of you.

142
00:09:23,720 --> 00:09:25,780
Don't worry. I'm not going anywhere.

143
00:09:55,120 --> 00:09:55,790
Xiaotao?

144
00:10:00,480 --> 00:10:02,120
Since you don't have time to
explain things to me,

145
00:10:02,120 --> 00:10:03,720
I had to come find you myself.

146
00:10:05,030 --> 00:10:07,430
Your team is about to
play in the semifinal.

147
00:10:07,440 --> 00:10:08,370
Do you know that?

148
00:10:09,720 --> 00:10:11,250
Why are you telling me this?

149
00:10:12,720 --> 00:10:14,380
Send Bai Xue a WeChat message.

150
00:10:14,630 --> 00:10:15,360
What for?

151
00:10:15,750 --> 00:10:16,390
Tell her

152
00:10:16,390 --> 00:10:18,750
you're playing in that game
no matter what.

153
00:10:18,750 --> 00:10:19,600
Talk it over with her:

154
00:10:19,600 --> 00:10:20,600
once nationals are over,

155
00:10:20,600 --> 00:10:22,860
you'll get busy with her projects, okay?

156
00:10:31,550 --> 00:10:32,750
Stop it!

157
00:10:32,790 --> 00:10:33,720
If it weren't for Bai Xue's
advance payment,

158
00:10:33,720 --> 00:10:36,120
I couldn't even afford to
keep living here!

159
00:10:36,270 --> 00:10:38,240
W-What do you mean?

160
00:10:52,120 --> 00:10:54,440
The company I was interning at went under.

161
00:10:54,440 --> 00:10:56,240
I haven't been paid for 2 months.

162
00:10:56,510 --> 00:10:58,840
The landlord keeps pushing me to move out.

163
00:11:02,000 --> 00:11:02,750
Xiaotao,

164
00:11:03,790 --> 00:11:04,720
I need money.

165
00:11:07,720 --> 00:11:09,550
If you need money, you can tell me.

166
00:11:09,550 --> 00:11:10,840
I can lend you some.

167
00:11:10,840 --> 00:11:11,390
Can we talk about

168
00:11:11,390 --> 00:11:13,270
everything else after the games?

169
00:11:13,960 --> 00:11:15,360
I know you guys
have been preparing for nationals

170
00:11:15,360 --> 00:11:16,510
for a very long time,

171
00:11:16,510 --> 00:11:18,040
and you really want to play!

172
00:11:24,080 --> 00:11:24,790
What are you doing?

173
00:11:24,790 --> 00:11:25,750
Transferring money to you.

174
00:11:25,750 --> 00:11:26,750
I won't accept it.

175
00:11:28,200 --> 00:11:29,550
Consider it a loan.

176
00:11:29,550 --> 00:11:31,870
You can pay me back after the games.

177
00:11:33,600 --> 00:11:35,320
I don't want your money.

178
00:11:35,910 --> 00:11:37,320
I want to stand on my own two feet

179
00:11:37,320 --> 00:11:38,790
and give you a stable life.

180
00:11:38,790 --> 00:11:40,200
I don't want that kind of life!

181
00:11:40,200 --> 00:11:41,200
But I need it!

182
00:11:44,240 --> 00:11:45,270
Your dad was right!

183
00:11:45,270 --> 00:11:47,320
How can I give you a stable life
just by playing basketball?

184
00:11:47,320 --> 00:11:48,200
I can't even afford next month's rent

185
00:11:48,200 --> 00:11:49,720
after buying you a bag!

186
00:11:49,720 --> 00:11:50,320
And I still need to

187
00:11:50,320 --> 00:11:52,150
rely on you to
cover all the household expenses!

188
00:11:52,150 --> 00:11:53,320
I'm in my senior year of college now.

189
00:11:53,320 --> 00:11:55,580
I have to think about our future, don't I?

190
00:12:09,320 --> 00:12:10,510
So...

191
00:12:11,390 --> 00:12:13,840
is that why you signed with Bai Xue?

192
00:12:18,240 --> 00:12:19,480
Are you dating me

193
00:12:19,480 --> 00:12:21,150
or my dad?

194
00:12:21,480 --> 00:12:23,440
Our relationship is
just between the two of us.

195
00:12:23,440 --> 00:12:25,000
Why do you care what he says?

196
00:12:42,000 --> 00:12:43,930
If you're doing this because of me,

197
00:12:45,390 --> 00:12:46,960
go negotiate with Bai Xue

198
00:12:46,960 --> 00:12:48,420
and return to the JCU Team,

199
00:12:48,840 --> 00:12:49,670
okay?

200
00:12:55,960 --> 00:12:57,690
If others don't understand me,

201
00:12:57,960 --> 00:12:58,790
so be it.

202
00:13:00,600 --> 00:13:02,660
But why can't even you understand me?

203
00:13:10,720 --> 00:13:11,360
Just go.

204
00:13:15,320 --> 00:13:16,000
I'm tired.

205
00:13:27,550 --> 00:13:28,440
Li Sirui,

206
00:13:29,910 --> 00:13:31,630
I don't want you to give up

207
00:13:31,750 --> 00:13:33,150
your dream for me.

208
00:13:37,960 --> 00:13:39,030
Get some good rest.

209
00:14:04,700 --> 00:14:08,850
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

210
00:14:10,630 --> 00:14:11,240
Come on.

211
00:14:11,960 --> 00:14:13,160
-Captain?
-Captain!

212
00:14:14,850 --> 00:14:15,920
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

213
00:14:16,200 --> 00:14:17,330
The captain's here!

214
00:14:17,450 --> 00:14:18,030
Captain.

215
00:14:17,730 --> 00:14:19,290
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

216
00:14:18,360 --> 00:14:18,910
-I'm fine.
-Captain.

217
00:14:18,910 --> 00:14:19,720
-Captain.
-Captain!

218
00:14:19,720 --> 00:14:20,550
Captain, you're back.

219
00:14:20,550 --> 00:14:21,840
-Are you okay?
-I'm fine now.

220
00:14:21,840 --> 00:14:23,270
Captain, why are you here?

221
00:14:23,270 --> 00:14:25,720
Didn't Tian tell you
to rest for a few more days?

222
00:14:25,720 --> 00:14:26,650
How is your knee?

223
00:14:27,720 --> 00:14:29,320
My knee has recovered pretty well.

224
00:14:29,320 --> 00:14:30,550
I'm fine now. Don't worry, everyone.

225
00:14:30,550 --> 00:14:35,450
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

226
00:14:31,270 --> 00:14:32,000
That's good.

227
00:14:32,150 --> 00:14:33,350
-Pass it here.
-Yeah.

228
00:14:37,510 --> 00:14:38,510
-Nice.
-Nice shot.

229
00:14:38,510 --> 00:14:39,550
-Nice.
-Still got it.

230
00:14:39,550 --> 00:14:41,070
We've been worrying about you every day.

231
00:14:41,070 --> 00:14:42,510
We've finally made it to the semifinal.

232
00:14:42,510 --> 00:14:43,770
How could I give up now?

233
00:14:44,200 --> 00:14:45,800
It's so good to have you back.

234
00:14:46,150 --> 00:14:47,810
You should get some more rest.

235
00:14:48,120 --> 00:14:49,790
Come back after the semifinal.

236
00:14:49,790 --> 00:14:51,790
Tian, I've almost fully recovered.

237
00:14:52,320 --> 00:14:54,670
I didn't put you down
for today's training.

238
00:14:54,670 --> 00:14:55,730
If you want to stay,

239
00:14:55,840 --> 00:14:57,120
just watch from the sidelines.

240
00:14:57,120 --> 00:14:58,360
Everyone else, carry on.

241
00:14:58,360 --> 00:14:58,790
Tian.

242
00:14:58,790 --> 00:14:59,920
Go back to training!

243
00:15:02,960 --> 00:15:03,510
Okay.

244
00:15:03,510 --> 00:15:04,670
-Let's go.
-Let's go back to training.

245
00:15:04,670 --> 00:15:05,270
Go back to training.

246
00:15:05,270 --> 00:15:06,730
Let's go back to training.

247
00:15:07,720 --> 00:15:09,630
Isn't it just fluid buildup in his knee?

248
00:15:09,630 --> 00:15:10,960
What's the big deal?

249
00:15:11,120 --> 00:15:14,180
Maybe he's just being
extra protective of the captain.

250
00:15:17,720 --> 00:15:18,320
Come on.

251
00:15:20,360 --> 00:15:21,620
Good, keep the rhythm.

252
00:15:24,600 --> 00:15:26,930
Make sure you execute the drive properly.

253
00:15:36,120 --> 00:15:37,440
Keep up back there!

254
00:15:38,790 --> 00:15:39,450
Keep going!

255
00:15:47,670 --> 00:15:48,270
Tian.

256
00:15:48,790 --> 00:15:50,000
Don't even think about it.

257
00:15:50,000 --> 00:15:51,460
Just get some proper rest.

258
00:15:52,240 --> 00:15:52,840
Tian,

259
00:15:53,440 --> 00:15:54,870
if we make it to the finals,

260
00:15:54,870 --> 00:15:56,530
there'll only be 2 games left.

261
00:15:56,840 --> 00:15:58,970
I don't want to graduate with regrets.

262
00:16:21,170 --> 00:16:21,920
[Bai Xue Entertainment]

263
00:16:21,970 --> 00:16:23,170
[Bai Xue Basketball]

264
00:16:23,840 --> 00:16:24,670
Defense!

265
00:16:25,560 --> 00:16:27,080
[Own the Court. Take Action Now.]

266
00:16:28,480 --> 00:16:29,080
Come on.

267
00:16:30,120 --> 00:16:31,750
How is Li Sirui doing?

268
00:16:31,910 --> 00:16:33,150
He was fine a few days ago,

269
00:16:33,150 --> 00:16:34,320
but he's really off his game today.

270
00:16:34,320 --> 00:16:35,050
Pass!

271
00:16:35,160 --> 00:16:36,390
Quick! Pass!

272
00:16:37,510 --> 00:16:39,640
Defense! Defense! Stay with your man!

273
00:16:45,120 --> 00:16:46,750
For this livestream,

274
00:16:46,750 --> 00:16:49,390
we'll be featuring regular-season games
from various leagues,

275
00:16:49,390 --> 00:16:50,790
as well as the university semifinals,

276
00:16:50,790 --> 00:16:52,540
the third-place games, and the finals.

277
00:16:52,540 --> 00:16:54,420
[2019 The Starry Sky Project;
"24s" Livestream Room]

278
00:16:52,670 --> 00:16:53,360
As usual,

279
00:16:53,360 --> 00:16:54,910
everyone, claim your assignments.

280
00:16:54,910 --> 00:16:57,440
I'll take the regular season
in the Southern Division.

281
00:16:57,440 --> 00:16:59,040
Then I'll work with Mr. Yang.

282
00:16:59,150 --> 00:16:59,750
Okay.

283
00:17:00,790 --> 00:17:01,720
Director Zhang,

284
00:17:02,630 --> 00:17:04,790
I'd like to host the livestream
for JCU's semifinal.

285
00:17:04,790 --> 00:17:05,440
Is that okay?

286
00:17:05,440 --> 00:17:07,700
[2019 The Starry Sky Project;
"24s" Livestream Room]

287
00:17:05,640 --> 00:17:06,640
Xiangxiang, you're so proactive,

288
00:17:06,640 --> 00:17:08,000
cheering for your own school.

289
00:17:08,000 --> 00:17:09,720
Just don't be too biased
during the livestream.

290
00:17:09,720 --> 00:17:11,680
Don't worry.
I guarantee I'll get the job done.

291
00:17:11,680 --> 00:17:14,680
Alright, let's continue with
the rest of the meeting.

292
00:17:16,170 --> 00:17:18,150
[2019 The Starry Sky Project;
"24s" Livestream Room]

293
00:17:27,930 --> 00:17:28,319
[UBA Livestream]

294
00:17:28,349 --> 00:17:28,820
[UBA Final]

295
00:17:42,880 --> 00:17:44,320
[Zhou Xiangxiang]

296
00:17:48,790 --> 00:17:49,270
Hello.

297
00:17:49,270 --> 00:17:49,880
Hello!

298
00:17:50,880 --> 00:17:51,940
You sound so happy.

299
00:17:52,590 --> 00:17:53,680
I only said one word,

300
00:17:53,680 --> 00:17:54,790
and you could already tell?

301
00:17:54,790 --> 00:17:57,190
I could tell
even before you said anything.

302
00:17:58,480 --> 00:17:59,240
Good news.

303
00:17:59,680 --> 00:18:01,080
The director has agreed.

304
00:18:01,480 --> 00:18:02,160
Your girlfriend

305
00:18:02,160 --> 00:18:03,590
will be broadcasting your semifinal

306
00:18:03,590 --> 00:18:05,200
to thousands of households.

307
00:18:05,680 --> 00:18:07,530
Congratulations, my girlfriend.

308
00:18:07,530 --> 00:18:09,920
You're welcome, my boyfriend.

309
00:18:11,310 --> 00:18:11,920
Oh, right.

310
00:18:12,720 --> 00:18:14,650
Has Tian cleared you to play again?

311
00:18:16,830 --> 00:18:18,310
I was just about to tell you.

312
00:18:18,310 --> 00:18:20,000
Starting today,
I'm allowed to train again.

313
00:18:20,000 --> 00:18:23,400
Just watch me play in the semifinal
from the livestream room.

314
00:18:23,830 --> 00:18:24,500
Wait!

315
00:18:27,030 --> 00:18:27,680
Bye-bye.

316
00:18:53,960 --> 00:18:54,590
Xiaotao.

317
00:19:20,270 --> 00:19:22,070
What did you want to see me about?

318
00:19:24,750 --> 00:19:26,680
I just wanted to see my girlfriend.

319
00:19:28,800 --> 00:19:31,640
Now that you've signed with a big company,
you're a busy man.

320
00:19:31,640 --> 00:19:33,500
How would you have time to miss me?

321
00:19:38,830 --> 00:19:39,440
Here.

322
00:19:40,110 --> 00:19:42,510
I ordered these drinks especially for you.

323
00:19:42,790 --> 00:19:44,250
These are your favorites.

324
00:19:48,310 --> 00:19:48,920
What?

325
00:19:49,590 --> 00:19:50,720
You don't want them?

326
00:19:51,750 --> 00:19:53,480
Should I order something else?

327
00:19:53,750 --> 00:19:56,080
Or should I have the waiter
take them away?

328
00:19:57,550 --> 00:19:58,160
It's fine.

329
00:19:58,640 --> 00:20:00,070
I'll just have one.

330
00:20:10,790 --> 00:20:11,590
Xiaotao.

331
00:20:14,070 --> 00:20:14,960
I'm sorry.

332
00:20:17,110 --> 00:20:18,110
I got

333
00:20:18,270 --> 00:20:20,240
too emotional a while back.

334
00:20:22,240 --> 00:20:23,970
But after thinking about it...

335
00:20:26,110 --> 00:20:28,510
I realized
you were only looking out for me.

336
00:20:38,370 --> 00:20:39,170
Are you okay?

337
00:20:40,110 --> 00:20:41,110
I-I'm fine.

338
00:20:41,440 --> 00:20:44,270
My contact lenses are just a little dry.

339
00:20:48,350 --> 00:20:49,070
Um...

340
00:20:49,880 --> 00:20:53,610
How have things been at Bai Xue's company
these past couple of days?

341
00:20:54,960 --> 00:20:55,750
Pretty good.

342
00:20:56,720 --> 00:20:57,640
Ms. Bai

343
00:20:58,350 --> 00:20:59,640
values me a lot.

344
00:21:00,350 --> 00:21:01,200
Every day after practice,

345
00:21:01,200 --> 00:21:03,510
she has me stay behind for extra training.

346
00:21:03,510 --> 00:21:06,510
She also said I have
great qualities across the board.

347
00:21:06,680 --> 00:21:07,480
Are you tired?

348
00:21:18,480 --> 00:21:19,830
Not when I see you.

349
00:21:26,200 --> 00:21:26,880
Xiaotao.

350
00:21:29,960 --> 00:21:31,820
Please don't be mad at me anymore.

351
00:21:32,310 --> 00:21:33,030
Okay?

352
00:21:51,350 --> 00:21:52,070
Sirui.

353
00:21:53,680 --> 00:21:54,810
What a coincidence.

354
00:21:57,070 --> 00:21:57,790
Ms. Bai.

355
00:22:01,200 --> 00:22:02,480
Why are you here too?

356
00:22:03,790 --> 00:22:04,830
Who is this?

357
00:22:11,230 --> 00:22:12,230
Your girlfriend?

358
00:22:14,830 --> 00:22:15,720
She is...

359
00:22:17,590 --> 00:22:19,750
my junior, Le Xiaotao.

360
00:22:27,680 --> 00:22:28,610
You two carry on.

361
00:22:28,680 --> 00:22:29,740
I won't bother you.

362
00:22:35,070 --> 00:22:36,310
But let me remind you:

363
00:22:36,720 --> 00:22:38,380
don't violate your contract.

364
00:22:39,510 --> 00:22:40,110
Ms. Bai,

365
00:22:40,750 --> 00:22:42,110
-I...
-What contract?

366
00:22:43,000 --> 00:22:43,750
Xiaotao,

367
00:22:44,400 --> 00:22:45,000
well...

368
00:22:46,640 --> 00:22:47,640
I'm his girlfriend.

369
00:22:47,640 --> 00:22:50,040
What does that
have to do with his contract?

370
00:22:51,400 --> 00:22:54,240
Then I suppose I should explain.

371
00:22:54,960 --> 00:22:57,030
Our company requires
all newly signed players

372
00:22:57,030 --> 00:22:59,690
to remain single
during their contract period.

373
00:23:00,510 --> 00:23:01,110
Of course.

374
00:23:01,310 --> 00:23:02,400
That's so relationships don't

375
00:23:02,400 --> 00:23:04,110
interfere with
the company's plans for them.

376
00:23:04,110 --> 00:23:04,960
It's stated

377
00:23:05,000 --> 00:23:06,690
very clearly in the contract.

378
00:23:06,930 --> 00:23:07,990
Don't forget that.

379
00:23:36,750 --> 00:23:38,110
Xiaotao, you...

380
00:23:39,110 --> 00:23:41,170
Sit. I'll explain everything to you.

381
00:23:41,200 --> 00:23:43,350
You actually signed a contract like that?

382
00:23:43,350 --> 00:23:44,550
No, no, Xiaotao.

383
00:23:44,790 --> 00:23:45,960
The contract says

384
00:23:45,960 --> 00:23:48,110
no dating
during the initial stage after signing.

385
00:23:48,110 --> 00:23:50,370
But once my career is stable, none of this

386
00:23:50,590 --> 00:23:52,050
will be a problem anymore.

387
00:23:52,070 --> 00:23:52,920
Sirui,

388
00:23:53,920 --> 00:23:56,030
do you really think
you're a celebrity now?

389
00:23:56,030 --> 00:23:59,030
You're planning to
keep me as your secret girlfriend, huh?

390
00:23:59,030 --> 00:24:00,000
No, Xiaotao.

391
00:24:00,680 --> 00:24:01,510
I thought

392
00:24:01,510 --> 00:24:04,350
maybe we could
just keep things low-key at first.

393
00:24:04,350 --> 00:24:05,930
Once my career is stable,

394
00:24:06,110 --> 00:24:07,710
it won't be an issue anymore.

395
00:24:11,750 --> 00:24:13,070
I was so naive.

396
00:24:14,550 --> 00:24:15,510
I thought

397
00:24:16,310 --> 00:24:18,110
you'd signed because of

398
00:24:18,550 --> 00:24:21,080
what my dad said—
that you were doing it for me.

399
00:24:22,160 --> 00:24:25,640
Turns out...
you were only doing it for yourself.

400
00:24:25,880 --> 00:24:26,480
No.

401
00:24:26,960 --> 00:24:28,000
No, Xiaotao.

402
00:24:28,440 --> 00:24:30,920
I never thought about
breaking up with you,

403
00:24:30,960 --> 00:24:33,090
nor did I ever think about leaving you.

404
00:24:35,590 --> 00:24:36,320
It's just...

405
00:24:36,960 --> 00:24:37,720
So,

406
00:24:38,640 --> 00:24:40,440
if you can leave your buddies behind,

407
00:24:40,440 --> 00:24:42,900
you can walk away from me
anytime too, right?

408
00:24:46,440 --> 00:24:47,270
Xiaotao,

409
00:24:48,110 --> 00:24:49,440
you've got me all wrong.

410
00:24:52,160 --> 00:24:54,090
Don't come looking for me anymore.

411
00:24:54,880 --> 00:24:57,410
I can't afford to
get in the way of your career.

412
00:25:08,200 --> 00:25:08,880
Xiaotao!

413
00:26:01,720 --> 00:26:02,880
Have some cookies.

414
00:26:06,550 --> 00:26:08,110
Do you want some of this?

415
00:26:14,070 --> 00:26:16,880
I didn't expect
Li Sirui to be such a jerk.

416
00:26:19,720 --> 00:26:20,920
Alright, Xiaotao.

417
00:26:20,960 --> 00:26:22,550
Stop thinking about that scumbag.

418
00:26:22,550 --> 00:26:25,310
He abandoned his girlfriend and buddies
for his own benefit.

419
00:26:25,310 --> 00:26:26,750
It's probably better that you left him
sooner rather than later.

420
00:26:26,750 --> 00:26:27,750
Exactly.

421
00:26:28,200 --> 00:26:29,350
"A gentleman is open and honest,

422
00:26:29,350 --> 00:26:31,200
while a petty man is always anxious."

423
00:26:31,200 --> 00:26:33,680
Li Sirui lacks
even the most basic honesty.

424
00:26:34,000 --> 00:26:35,240
He should've at least told you

425
00:26:35,240 --> 00:26:37,000
before he signed that kind of contract.

426
00:26:37,000 --> 00:26:38,920
Making a decision first
and telling you afterward?

427
00:26:38,920 --> 00:26:40,920
I definitely don't approve of that.

428
00:26:41,000 --> 00:26:42,330
Telling her afterward?

429
00:26:42,400 --> 00:26:44,400
He never intended to tell her at all.

430
00:26:49,310 --> 00:26:50,200
Tell me,

431
00:26:50,680 --> 00:26:53,200
did he ever really love me?

432
00:27:06,920 --> 00:27:07,790
Xiaotao.

433
00:27:09,590 --> 00:27:10,830
You can't say that.

434
00:27:11,400 --> 00:27:12,480
Maybe his behavior

435
00:27:12,480 --> 00:27:14,340
looks terrible to everyone else.

436
00:27:14,640 --> 00:27:16,700
But your relationship is different.

437
00:27:17,550 --> 00:27:19,680
You've heard his explanation, right?

438
00:27:19,880 --> 00:27:22,720
He really is
under a lot of pressure, right?

439
00:27:24,590 --> 00:27:26,000
Knowing him as I do,

440
00:27:26,790 --> 00:27:29,320
I'm sure his plans
for the future include you.

441
00:27:30,160 --> 00:27:30,830
Maybe...

442
00:27:31,310 --> 00:27:33,070
maybe he was just so anxious,

443
00:27:33,550 --> 00:27:35,550
so eager to give you a secure future,

444
00:27:36,590 --> 00:27:38,550
that things ended up like this.

445
00:27:39,790 --> 00:27:41,240
You can't deny his feelings

446
00:27:41,240 --> 00:27:43,240
for you just because of this, right?

447
00:27:50,830 --> 00:27:51,920
There, there.

448
00:28:11,270 --> 00:28:12,000
Hurry up. Hurry.

449
00:28:12,000 --> 00:28:12,590
Come on!

450
00:28:17,270 --> 00:28:17,880
Alright.

451
00:28:21,600 --> 00:28:24,520
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

452
00:28:23,030 --> 00:28:24,830
Captain, is your knee okay?

453
00:28:24,830 --> 00:28:25,440
It's fine.

454
00:28:26,200 --> 00:28:27,640
I've only just recovered.

455
00:28:27,640 --> 00:28:28,270
Sorry.

456
00:28:28,790 --> 00:28:30,250
Let's call it a day for now.

457
00:28:30,590 --> 00:28:32,160
We all get injured at some point.

458
00:28:32,160 --> 00:28:33,830
Full recovery takes time.

459
00:28:33,920 --> 00:28:34,720
Don't rush it.

460
00:28:35,480 --> 00:28:36,240
That's right, Captain.

461
00:28:36,240 --> 00:28:37,590
Let's head back together later.

462
00:28:37,590 --> 00:28:38,250
No, thanks.

463
00:28:38,880 --> 00:28:40,940
Xiangxiang is coming to see me later.

464
00:28:41,960 --> 00:28:43,830
That sudden PDA

465
00:28:43,960 --> 00:28:46,160
-really took me by surprise!
-Let's go.

466
00:29:19,070 --> 00:29:20,310
I never expected Xiaotao's dad

467
00:29:20,310 --> 00:29:22,040
to say those things to Li Sirui.

468
00:29:23,830 --> 00:29:25,230
Thinking about it now...

469
00:29:25,880 --> 00:29:28,160
even though Li Sirui
didn't handle things very well,

470
00:29:28,160 --> 00:29:30,820
those two really
can't seem to let each other go.

471
00:29:32,110 --> 00:29:33,830
We don't know what he's been through,

472
00:29:33,830 --> 00:29:36,030
but don't let his
usual joking manner fool you.

473
00:29:36,030 --> 00:29:36,960
When something serious happens,

474
00:29:36,960 --> 00:29:38,760
he never tells anyone anything.

475
00:29:48,750 --> 00:29:49,960
I'm going to grab a package.

476
00:29:49,960 --> 00:29:51,000
Don't move. I'll get it.

477
00:29:51,000 --> 00:29:53,200
It's okay. It's right outside the door.

478
00:30:21,920 --> 00:30:22,130
[Compound Tramadol Tablets]

479
00:30:23,950 --> 00:30:25,560
[Compound Tramadol Tablets]

480
00:30:27,610 --> 00:30:30,330
[Primarily used for
cancer-related and traumatic pain.]

481
00:30:49,070 --> 00:30:49,870
What's wrong?

482
00:30:52,440 --> 00:30:53,030
Nothing.

483
00:30:55,630 --> 00:30:57,830
Sit. I'll go make you something delicious.

484
00:30:57,830 --> 00:30:58,440
Okay.

485
00:31:45,000 --> 00:31:45,800
What's wrong?

486
00:31:50,880 --> 00:31:52,350
I made this bone broth especially for you.

487
00:31:52,350 --> 00:31:54,150
Try it. It's really nourishing.

488
00:31:55,480 --> 00:31:56,640
My injury's already healed.

489
00:31:56,640 --> 00:31:58,350
If I keep eating like this,
I'll gain weight.

490
00:31:58,350 --> 00:32:01,110
They say an injury to the tendons and bones
takes 100 days to heal.

491
00:32:01,110 --> 00:32:02,750
It's only been a short time
since your injury.

492
00:32:02,750 --> 00:32:03,680
Try my cooking.

493
00:32:11,350 --> 00:32:12,350
Well? Is it good?

494
00:32:19,830 --> 00:32:22,000
Don't you have a follow-up appointment
this afternoon?

495
00:32:22,000 --> 00:32:22,590
Yes.

496
00:32:23,750 --> 00:32:25,680
I heard from Yu You yesterday

497
00:32:25,880 --> 00:32:28,140
that she knows an excellent orthopedist

498
00:32:28,270 --> 00:32:30,030
who used to do rehab for athletes.

499
00:32:30,030 --> 00:32:32,560
Why don't we go consult
this doctor together?

500
00:32:34,070 --> 00:32:34,720
No need.

501
00:32:35,790 --> 00:32:36,790
Hasn't my current doctor

502
00:32:36,790 --> 00:32:39,200
already put together
a treatment plan for me?

503
00:32:39,200 --> 00:32:41,830
Having 2 doctors treat me at once

504
00:32:42,350 --> 00:32:43,880
probably isn't a good idea.

505
00:32:44,750 --> 00:32:45,480
That's true.

506
00:32:46,830 --> 00:32:48,890
Then I'll go with you this afternoon.

507
00:32:50,240 --> 00:32:51,170
This afternoon?

508
00:32:51,880 --> 00:32:53,790
But don't you have a class in your major?

509
00:32:53,790 --> 00:32:54,920
Focus on your class.

510
00:33:00,510 --> 00:33:02,070
I'll be fine. Don't worry.

511
00:33:03,400 --> 00:33:04,830
Eat up. Here.

512
00:33:18,250 --> 00:33:20,750
[Emergency] [Outpatient]

513
00:33:24,430 --> 00:33:25,200
[Emergency]

514
00:33:25,200 --> 00:33:27,410
[Outpatient]

515
00:33:37,110 --> 00:33:39,910
[Jiangcheng People's Hospital;
Orthopedic Specialist Consultation Room]

516
00:33:44,680 --> 00:33:45,980
[Jiangcheng People's Hospital;
Orthopedic Specialist Consultation Room]

517
00:33:57,270 --> 00:33:58,550
I've looked at your report.

518
00:33:58,550 --> 00:34:00,680
From now on, you must absolutely avoid

519
00:34:00,680 --> 00:34:02,540
this kind of strenuous exercise.

520
00:34:19,670 --> 00:34:21,199
Make sure you get more rest.

521
00:34:40,760 --> 00:34:41,670
Who are you?

522
00:34:41,670 --> 00:34:42,550
Hello, doctor.

523
00:34:42,960 --> 00:34:44,110
Sorry to bother you.

524
00:34:44,510 --> 00:34:47,440
I'm the girlfriend
of the young man who was just here.

525
00:34:48,280 --> 00:34:49,110
Nothing serious.

526
00:34:49,110 --> 00:34:51,440
Just keep an eye on them
during the IV drip.

527
00:34:51,659 --> 00:34:57,660
[Blood Transfusion Department]
[Clinical Laboratory]

528
00:34:51,710 --> 00:34:52,710
Dr. Ao?

529
00:34:55,150 --> 00:34:56,320
Zhou Xiangxiang?

530
00:34:56,630 --> 00:34:58,000
You came with Gu Han for his checkup?

531
00:34:57,660 --> 00:35:01,380
[Pathology Department]

532
00:34:59,400 --> 00:35:01,400
There's something I want to ask you.

533
00:35:02,000 --> 00:35:03,860
I hope you'll answer me honestly.

534
00:35:04,320 --> 00:35:04,920
Go ahead.

535
00:35:07,110 --> 00:35:10,110
Does Gu Han really only have
fluid buildup in his knee?

536
00:35:10,480 --> 00:35:11,110
Yes.

537
00:35:11,710 --> 00:35:12,320
Yes.

538
00:35:13,280 --> 00:35:13,880
Yes.

539
00:35:14,800 --> 00:35:15,400
Fine.

540
00:35:15,760 --> 00:35:17,510
If I take him to another hospital
for a second opinion

541
00:35:17,510 --> 00:35:19,840
and his injury gets worse after the games,

542
00:35:20,110 --> 00:35:21,590
I'll sue you, Ao Ziyi, for misdiagnosis!
